#: applications/trota-common/trota_common/diagnostics.py:102
msgid "There is enough free disk space."
msgstr "Lo spazio libero su disco è sufficiente."

#: applications/trota-common/trota_common/diagnostics.py:103
msgid "Free disk space is getting low."
